  <text xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0421.adelon_dramaton.meineke1840-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><body n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0421.adelon_dramaton.meineke1840-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0421.adelon_dramaton.meineke1840-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0421_adelon_dramaton"><head>ΑΔΗΛΩΝ ΔΡΑΜΑΤΩΝ</head><pb n="364" facs="urn:hathi:hvd.32044079388682:scan:372" />
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="1" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0421-adelon_dramaton-1">
              <head>I.</head>
              <quote>
                <lg>
                  <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0421-adelon_dramaton-1-l1">Τὸ τέλος ἅπασίν ἐστι τοῖς πτωχοῖσι νύξ·</l>
                  <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0421-adelon_dramaton-1-l2">ἐπισκοτεῖ γὰρ τοῖς κακοῖσι πανταχοῦ.</l>
                </lg>
              </quote>
              <note type="source">Stobaeus Floril. XCVI 23 cum lemmate <quote>Ἀριστοφῶντος</quote>.</note>
              <note type="apparatus">Locus forsitan ad Babiam referendus est.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="2" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0421-adelon_dramaton-2">
              <head>II.</head>
              <note type="source">Athenaeus II p. 63 a: <quote>Ἀντιφάνης δὲ διὰ τοῦ π φησὶν ἀσπάραγον — Ἀριστοφῶν <title>Κάππαριν</title>, βληχώ, θύμον, ἀσπάραγον, πίτταν, ῥάμνον, σφάκελον, τύμπανον.</quote>
              </note>
              <note type="apparatus">Pro πίτταν Schweighaeuserus γήτιον (γήτειον), Bodaeus ad Theophr. p. 638 πίτυν. Idem Bodaeus pro ῥάμνον coniecit ῥάφανον, σφακόν (sive potius σφάκον) pro σφάκελον, πήγανον pro τύμπανον.</note>
            </div>
          </div></body></text></TEI>